      "side": 1,
      "message": "Great idea!\n\nWill the warnUnconvertedDeps also skip the modules with unconverted deps? Or is it going to convert anyway with a warning?\n\nI feel that there\u0027s still some value in converting a module with unconverted deps, because the generated code is useful for experimenting and development, even if it\u0027s not buildable.\n\nEither way, I think we should always print a warning by default, whether modules or skipped or not. The default can be switched to error a little later to prevent backsliding.",
